    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University's East Africa Institute (EAI) has signed a partnership agreement with the Garden of Hope Foundation (GoHF). This collaboration will see the two organisations engage in projects of mutual interest concerning development, particularly as it affects under-resourced residents of informal settlements.",
